cholarship process from admission.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/expansion-20261022/italy-lazio-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-22\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-22\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/lazio-disco/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is DiSCo the same as a Sapienza scholarship?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. DiSCo is a regional benefit route. Sapienza admission and any university-specific award have their own procedures.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I still use the August 2026 deadline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"That published second-phase deadline has passed. Check current official notices for your application and intake; it does not establish a new round.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does being eligible guarantee a room?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Do not assume so. Eligibility, award status and accommodation allocation must be read separately in the current call and ranking.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L17"}],false,"$L18","$L19"]}]
